# P12 round 7: the Synth play page on Tracker+ (MK66 Shift + Perform, docs ref/synth-page-design.md). From the pattern editor Shift + Perform
# opens the page (the MIDI in mode goes to the page, Synth 1 is part A and gets the voices, the other parts none), pad 12 held plays its
# note through the page's router and lets go of it, a second press holds it for the shot, the release ends it, Pattern leaves the page.
# plus_flows.sh reads the page state afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SPLAY, splayLine): open with mode 5 and only part A voiced, a held cell,
# then none, and the last line closed with the MIDI in mode back.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Synth play page on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap Performance
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 1200ms
expect text "Synth A"
expect text "Bank A"
pad 12 hold 600ms
wait 400ms
pad 12 press
wait 500ms
shot splay
pad 12 release
wait 500ms
tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
